OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GToday:FChilly for most today, but      
OL,8,Fgenerally dry with sunshine favouring  
OL,9,Fthe southeast. Cloud turns thicker in  
OL,10,Fthe northwest through the afternoon    
OL,11,Fwith wet and windy weather moving into 
OL,12,FNorthern Ireland and western Scotland  
OL,13,Fbefore evening with a risk of gales.   
OL,15,GTonight:FTonight, wet weather and      
OL,16,Fstrong winds will persist in the north 
OL,17,Fand west, turning heavier at times and 
OL,18,Fwintry over northern hills. Remaining  
OL,19,Fdry across central and eastern England.
