OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GFriday:FCloudy and rather damp across  
OL,8,Fcentral and southern parts, feeling    
OL,9,Fparticularily chilly. Drier across     
OL,10,FScotland and Northern Ireland with     
OL,11,Flong sunny spells, scattered showers   
OL,12,Fand easing winds.                      
OL,14,GOutlook for Saturday to Monday:FTurning
OL,15,Fmilder, with persistent, heavy rain    
OL,16,Fspreading eastwards on Saturday across 
OL,17,Fthe south. Further rain and showers    
OL,18,Faffect the northwest Sunday into       
OL,19,FMonday, whilst elsewhere stays dry     
OL,20,Fwith sunny spells.                     
